sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant M as Manager/Launcher
    participant R as Runtime Host
    participant B as Broker
    participant W as Windows / Client

    U->>M: User action
    Note over M,R: correlationId C1
    M->>R: requestId R1 / operationId O1
    R->>R: emit operation started
    R->>B: requestId R2 / C1 / O1
    B->>B: caller + capability audit
    B->>W: bounded operation
    W-->>B: technical result
    B-->>R: technical result + evidence
    R->>W: fresh read-back / observation
    W-->>R: actual-state evidence
    R->>R: semantic verification
    alt verified
        R->>R: canonical owner commit
        R-->>M: SUCCESS
    else failed
        R->>R: rollback / safe fallback / recovery
        R-->>M: semantic failure outcome
    end
    Note over M,B: logs/traces correlate the flow but never replace canonical owners
